# carousel.js — Generic Carousel Base

## Layman's terms

Bare-bones carousel behavior: shuffle slides, dots for navigation, auto-advance, swipe, click-to-lightbox, dynamic height. Works for any amenity (tennis, yoga, etc.). No Browse by Event or album grids—those are in amenity-specific scripts (e.g. carousel-pickleball.js).

## Medium understanding

Vanilla JS. Finds all `[data-carousel]` elements, shuffles .carousel-slide in DOM, builds dots, auto-advance 3s, touch swipe, lightbox (arrows, Escape, click-off). Supports data-carousel-dynamic for aspect-ratio height; offsetWidth fallback for Thrive iframes. Images injected by build-carousel.js.

## Advanced

- **Selector:** [data-carousel], .carousel-track, .carousel-slide, .carousel-dots
- **Scope:** Works on any carousel; no specific container class required
- **Dynamic:** data-carousel-dynamic → height from image aspect ratio
- **Build:** Images from markdown via build-carousel.js
